{"id":62856,"mal_id":62856,"title":"Nijusseiki Denki Mokuroku: Eureka Evrika","englishTitle":"Sparks of Tomorrow","title_english":"Sparks of Tomorrow","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["20th Century Electricity Catalog"],"en":"Sparks of Tomorrow","ja":"二十世紀電氣目録-ユーレカ・エヴリカ-"},"synopsis":"In an alternate version of the early 20th century where technological progress evolved along a different path shaped by steam power, Kyoto is blanketed in constant smoke.\n\nA boy, hardened by the loss of his brother, grows distrustful after their shared dream of an \"Age of Electricity\" is cut short. A deeply devout girl hides her dreams and regrets for her deceased mother deep within her heart. When the two cross paths, they set about exploring the secrets of the 20th Century Electrical Catalog, a glimpse into the future they long for.\n\nTogether, they must confront their pasts and carve a path toward the future they once believed in.\n\n(Source: Press Release)","synopsis_es":"En una versión alternativa de principios del siglo XX, en la que el progreso tecnológico evolucionó por un camino diferente marcado por la energía del vapor, Kioto está cubierto de humo constante.\n\nUn niño, endurecido por la pérdida de su hermano, se vuelve desconfiado después de que su sueño compartido de una \"Era de la electricidad\" se ve truncado. Una niña profundamente devota esconde sus sueños y el arrepentimiento por su madre fallecida en lo más profundo de su corazón. Cuando los dos se cruzan, se ponen a explorar los secretos del Catálogo Eléctrico del Siglo XX, un vistazo al futuro que anhelan.\n\nJuntos, deben enfrentar su pasado y forjar un camino hacia el futuro en el que alguna vez creyeron.\n\n(Fuente: Comunicado de prensa)","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1432,"average_episode_duration":1432,"startDate":"2026-07-05","start_date":"2026-07-05","endDate":"2026-09-27","end_date":"2026-09-27","season":"summer","year":2026,"start_season":{"